  (text "SuperMini: 5V pin = its USB VBUS (no diode): +5V from the shield only with USB unplugged.\nOnboard LDO makes 3V3_BOARD. USB (console), EN, BOOT and the RGB LED (IO48) stay on the board.\nDevKitC-1 build: GSM on IO17/IO18 instead of IO43/IO44." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 176 182 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "46d832da-bad4-4b0f-9cab-1b0f68e7f4a2"))
