  (text "Silkscreen: GND  TX (5 V level!) -> IO44  RX <- IO43  PK = BOOT/PWRKEY  VSS = VCC 5V in  NET\n6 NET -> R4 1k -> LED1 (NETLIGHT: 0.8 s searching, 3 s registered, 0.3 s GPRS)  7 DTR  8 RING  9-12 audio: unused.\nTX high side is pulled to VCC through 4.7k on the board: R3 divides it to ~3.0 V for IO44.\nPK <- R5 1k <- IO7 (open drain), C2 100n PK to GND, at the ESP end: a bare wire carried every attach burst in.\nVBAT is 3.64 V (MIC29302). C1 1000 uF across VSS/GND right at the board's pins (+ to VSS): the onboard\n100+10+1 uF are not enough on battery (reset every 30 s during registration without it). Short thick wires." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "650d77b0-fa22-4e5b-97df-f507096f6523"))
